  ('CMX-WHOLE-BLACK-BEANS-560G-COSTENA', 'Whole Black Beans 560g Costena', null, 14.50, 'A staple in Mexican kitchens, La Sierra brings you perfectly cooked whole black beans (frijoles negros enteros) ready to heat and enjoy. Whether as a side, in soups, or part of your favorite burrito, these beans are rich in flavor and nutrition. 🫘 Traditional whole black beans 🍽️ Ideal for tacos, soups, rice dishes &amp; more 🥄 Ready-to-eat – no soaking or cooking required 📦 560g can – great for families or food service 🇲🇽 Product of Mexico', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0642/6725/5904/files/Screenshot2026-03-10131531.png?v=1773134145', 50, 'Intermex UAE', false, false),
