  ('CMX-BLACK-BEANS-DRY-900G-LA-SIERRA', 'Black Beans Dry 900g, La sierra', null, 19.50, 'La Sierra Dried Black Beans 900g are high-quality dried black beans, a staple ingredient in many traditional dishes. Known for their rich flavour and firm texture, black beans are versatile and suitable for a wide range of recipes, from everyday meals to slow-cooked dishes. Once cooked, they become creamy on the inside while holding their shape well.', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0642/6725/5904/files/Screenshot2026-03-10124913.png?v=1773132616', 50, 'Intermex UAE', false, false),
